hi this is Alexander Bergen doll with  another video showing up some new  features from our latest update and to  when you launch the game you will notice  a few improvements to the main menu such  as improved readability of the input  options at the bottom of the screen a  new dynamic tile that takes you to the  character customization menu and overall  improve stability and flow in the store  we've added over a dozen new items from  our brand partners as well as a few more  fun items we've also implemented new  character animations in the store that  add a bit more life and movement to the  scene once in game you will immediately  see a new spawn selection camera that  shows more of the spawn area and give  you a better understanding of why the  spawn point is located on the mountain  it is still missing a proper UI but we  think this is much better than our  previous cameras that we implemented in  the last update we've updated and  improved or gameplay camera from all the  feedback we received since the last  updates the camera is now centered again  not too close to the fair and should  give a better sense of speed a new  animation has been added when loading up  a spin which will give you a better  visual cue as to what you are doing  we've added ski trails to the game in  this update we've spent a lot of time  making sure they are lightweight so they  don't cause performance issues you  should see your tracks remain during  long play sessions particle effects are  working again and have been rebuilt to  be more dynamic and realistic now when  you stop or perform a harder turn you  should see some snow spray finally we  have added a real posi- that you stop  using getting confused about respawning  on the mountain  we have begun implementing an event  system and snow this is the first  working version we have and it is  currently quite simple and uses some  debug UI in future updates we will be  adding more events with different goals  we look forward to hearing your feedback  on the steam forums thanks again for  watching
 

